# Runtime state, credentials, generated packages, and logs never belong in Git.
**/data/*
!**/data/.gitkeep
**/conf/*
!**/conf/README.md
!**/conf/*.example
!**/conf/*.example.*
**/install/cache/
**/install/downloads/
**/install/genisom_l1_sdk/
**/install/*.lock.local

# Small legacy resources moved from the repository root remain reproducible.
!nx-edge/data/jszr/legacy-robot-map/
!nx-edge/data/jszr/legacy-robot-map/*
!nx-edge/data/rosbags/legacy-patrol-data/
!nx-edge/data/rosbags/legacy-patrol-data/*
